st4 call kis s4 4 p2 4
y0 and kk d4
y1 and y0 found
ym0 and y1 isnum
ym and ym0 m4
lk shl li 4
lk2 add lk ck
mi add lk2 1424
v4 call num s4 10000
c3 select ym 1 0
s5 fold wr64 c3 s4 mi v4
ran call hashis s5 p2 42
yr0 and y1 isstr
yr1 and yr0 st4
yr and yr1 ran
ri add lk2 2448
c4 select yr 1 0
s6 fold wr64 c4 s5 ri 1
# kernels.K.startup*.LID
gi call kis s6 3 p2 17
gc call kis s6 3 p2 18
gs or gi gc
g1 select gc 1 0
z0 and kk d4
z1 and z0 isnum
zs and z1 gs
cntw add g1 130
cnt call g s6 cntw
tb0 shl g1 6
tb add tb0 3472
sh call key s6 4
ei call lookup s6 tb cnt sh
new eq ei cnt
zn and zs new
c5 select zn 1 0
hs add tb ei
s7 fold wr64 c5 s6 hs sh
en add tb0 ei
enl add en 3600
en8 shl en 3
ens add en8 3728
s8 call savecap s7 zn ens enl
cnt1 add cnt 1
s9 fold wr64 c5 s8 cntw cnt1
sv call num s9 1000000
sv1 add sv 1
e16 shl en 4
e16k add e16 ck
evi add e16k 4752
