# ---- axes: results/lang-axes.json, read into a table of its own. 128 languages; language s (< 64):
# id hash 192 + s, label 256 + 8s, label length 768 + s, family 832 + s (as in exec), kernel
# source tokens 896 + s, static check ms x 1000 + 1 at 1152 + s and check + run at 1216 + s (0 when
# the language has none); 1344 the largest 1-minute load average x 100 of any round, 1345 cpus.
fn haxes u32x128x64 u32 u32x128x512 -> u32x128x64
t call g p0 15
d call g p0 16
iskey eq t 1
isnum eq t 3
isstr eq t 2
d1 eq d 1
d2 eq d 2
d3 eq d 3
d5 eq d 5
