nv and kv isnew
tn or kt nv
x1 and x0 tn
c1 select x1 1 0
iw add nl 192
s1 fold wr64 c1 p0 iw lid
nl1 add nl 1
s2 fold wr64 c1 s1 128 nl1
n2 call g s2 128
sl call lookup s2 192 n2 lid
found lt sl n2
v3 and found d3
# tokens.ID.label, family, sumKernelTokens
